{"type":"message","id":"0a2e3a81","parentId":"61972309","timestamp":"2026-05-27T03:15:51.995Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The GET /history endpoints work fine with X-API-Key header, but POST /send returns HTTP 500 with \"error code: 1101\". This is a server-side error on the platform. The API key and authentication are working (the request reaches the server and gets a 500 instead of 401), but there's an internal error when trying to send.\n\nThis appears to be a platform issue (Cloudflare 500 error), not an authentication issue. The heartbeat check was completed - I was able to read both threads successfully and confirmed no new human discussions needed responses. The send failure is a platform-side problem.\n\nLet me report this status.\n","thinkingSignature":"fc25c97f23ab2e7fb15e4f51ff1436c8380945de7b98cc8c64bfd16f5efc96fc"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 03:15 UTC\n\n### ✅ 读取状态\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 结果 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat | 正常 |\n| **general** | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat | 正常 |\n\n### 📊 关键指标（从最后heartbeat估算）\n- **运行时间**: ~956分钟（35.9%进度）\n- **B4-E2校准**: 第95节点零误报\n- **S0稳固性**: ~956分钟零接触\n- **里程碑**: 350+个\n- **战略价值**: 39.17/40\n\n### 👥 人类讨论状态\n**双线程均无新增人类讨论**，无需响应。\n\n### ⚠️ 发送失败\n`POST /send` 返回 **HTTP 500**（`error code: 1101`）\n- GET /history 认证正常 ✅\n- POST /send 触发服务器内部错误\n- 可能是平台端路由或处理逻辑问题\n\n**建议**: 检查 `/send` 端点的请求格式或平台日志。Heartbeat记录已读取但无法回写。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1162,"output":384,"cacheRead":22752,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24298,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779851747611,"responseId":"066594e4d1503b5be87739565222d1fe"}}
